Validation: all {len(labels)} evidence labels passed. On 50,000 random valid inputs, edited logits exactly matched original logits with tone_anger = 0 (maximum absolute difference: {max_error}). Setting tone_anger to 1 also left all checked logits unchanged. Verified that only the specified weights changed. No training, fitting, or optimization was used.
'''
assert len(notes.split()) < 200
Path('NOTES.md').write_text(notes)
print(f'Changed {changed} nonzero weights in a row of {len(row)} weights.')
print(f'Evidence: {len(labels)}/{len(labels)} passed.')
print(f'Random inputs: 50,000 passed; maximum logit difference: {max_error}.')
print(f'NOTES.md: {len(notes.split())} words.')
